# agent-project-ops (Cursor project rule)

This repository is bound to the methodology snapshot in `.agent-project-ops/`. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.agent-project-ops/PRINCIPLES.md` before proposing work.

- Chat is not state. GitHub Issues/PRs and git objects are.
- You propose; the Command Center disposer disposes. Do not self-Accept phases.
- PR merge is not Phase PASS.
- One write authority: `origin` (GitHub). Extra remotes are **projection** (mirror/FF only). Do not push topic branches there. Do not invent a second source of truth.
- Work in `.worktrees/{issue}-{owner}-{slug}` from the current **authority tip**. Keep the primary checkout clean.
- If remotes, freeze, evidence, or protection are missing: fail closed (`status:blocked`), do not force `main`.

Skills: `.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md` wrap `.agent-project-ops/skills/`.
